# Share links (specs/004-share-links): see the shares of an item, create, show, change and remove a public link, and the messages when the server limits
# sharing. Run after 17-sync-interrupted.walk with the same server (the fake holds a link, a user share, a group share, a share of another kind and the link of
# another user on /Books).
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeFiles
waitfor folderRow
# the app opens Files where it was left; go up to the root (a tap on Up at the root does nothing)
tap folderUp
wait 400
tap folderUp
wait 400
waitfor folderRow
shot @OUT@/179-root.png
# US2: select Books (the second row of the root) and open Share
tap folderSelect
wait 300
tap folderRow 1
wait 300
tap folderShare
waitfor shareRow
wait 400
shot @OUT@/180-share-list.png
expect shareItemName Books
expect shareRowTitle Public link
expect shareRowTitle User: Bob Example
expect shareRowTitle Group: Team Example
expect shareRowTitle Other kind of share
expect shareRowDetail Not yours
expect_absent shareLinkText
# a user share opens a read-only summary and nothing that changes it
tap shareRow 1
waitfor dialogText Bob Example
shot @OUT@/181-share-user-summary.png
expect dialogText Read only
tap footerButton 0
wait 300
# US1: create a link with a password, an expiry date and the upload permission; the confirmation says what the link allows and defaults to Cancel
tap shareCreate
waitfor shareFormCreate
shot @OUT@/182-share-form.png
expect shareFormAllows read this folder
expect shareFormNotice another link
tap shareFormPermissionRow 1
wait 300
expect shareFormAllows add files
tap shareFormPassword
wait 400
type Zx9-secret-pw
shot @OUT@/183-share-password-entry.png
key Return
wait 400
expect shareFormPassword Set
tap shareFormExpiry
wait 400
type 2026-12-31
key Return
wait 400
expect shareFormExpiry 2026
tap shareFormCreate
waitfor dialogText add files
expect dialogText password
shot @OUT@/184-share-confirm.png
# the first button is Cancel: nothing is created
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
expect_absent dialogText
tap shareFormCreate
waitfor dialogText add files
tap footerButton 1
waitfor shareRow
wait 800
shot @OUT@/185-share-created.png
expect shareRowDetail Read and upload
expect shareRowDetail Password
# SC-001: a read-only link with the defaults takes at most 8 taps from the folder listing (the screen is left and the item selected again)
tap shareBack
wait 400
tap folderSelectDone
wait 300
taps_reset
tap folderSelect
wait 300
tap folderRow 1
wait 300
tap folderShare
waitfor shareRow
tap shareCreate
waitfor shareFormCreate
tap shareFormCreate
waitfor dialogText read this folder
tap footerButton 1
wait 1200
expect_taps_max 8
shot @OUT@/186-share-created-defaults.png
# US3: the link of the first row is shown in full and cannot be tapped open; Back drops it
tap shareRow 0
waitfor shareLinkText
shot @OUT@/187-share-link.png
expect shareLinkText https://
expect shareLinkLength characters
tap shareLinkText
wait 300
expect shareLinkText https://
tap shareLinkCopy
wait 300
expect shareLinkCopied Copied
shot @OUT@/188-share-link-copied.png
# US4: set a password, set an expiry date and switch the folder link to read and upload; each change is confirmed and states its effect
tap shareLinkPassword
wait 400
type new-pw-123
key Return
waitfor dialogText password
shot @OUT@/189-share-change-password-confirm.png
tap footerButton 1
waitfor shareLinkText
wait 1200
expect shareLinkPassword Set
tap shareLinkExpiry
wait 400
type 2026-12-30
key Return
waitfor dialogText 2026
tap footerButton 1
wait 1200
expect shareLinkExpiry 2026
tap shareLinkPermission
waitfor choiceRow
shot @OUT@/190-share-change-permission.png
tap choiceRow 1
waitfor dialogText add files
tap footerButton 1
wait 1200
expect shareLinkPermission Read and upload
shot @OUT@/191-share-link-changed.png
# US5: remove the link: the confirmation names the item, says the file is not deleted and defaults to Cancel; at most 4 taps from the selected item
tap shareLinkRemove
waitfor dialogText stops working at once
expect dialogText Books
expect dialogText is not deleted
shot @OUT@/192-share-remove-confirm.png
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
expect shareLinkText https://
tap shareLinkRemove
waitfor dialogText stops working at once
tap footerButton 1
waitfor shareRow
wait 1000
shot @OUT@/193-share-removed.png
expect_absent shareLinkText
# US3, Back: the link of another user (the fourth row: user, group, other kind, then Carol's link) is shown, and dropped when the screen is left
tap shareRow 3
waitfor shareLinkText
expect shareLinkNotYours someone else
shot @OUT@/194-share-link-of-another-user.png
tap shareLinkBack
wait 400
expect_absent shareLinkText
waitfor shareRow
# Back out of every screen: the link, the rows and the rules are dropped
tap shareBack
wait 400
tap folderSelectDone
wait 300
